(7630353, 1236882, 101256, '<td valign="top">Changed from a 6 to an 8 on second viewing. Like the like contrast, the grays are perfect - great image.</td>', 'Changed from a 6 to an 8 on second viewing. Like the like contrast, the grays are perfect - great image.', '2019-05-23 12:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630354, 1236565, 101256, '<td valign="top">I changed this from a 6 to a 7. My only issue with this is it could have done with a crop of the cloud cover - makes it a better image in my opinion. However, we all know what opinions are....nice capture and processing.</td>', 'I changed this from a 6 to a 7. My only issue with this is it could have done with a crop of the cloud cover - makes it a better image in my opinion. However, we all know what opinions are....nice capture and processing.', '2019-05-23 12:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630355, 1236879, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like this, but its a little on the "ordinary" side if you will. However the way the gray scale was handled is really good - very nice.</td>', 'I like this, but its a little on the "ordinary" side if you will. However the way the gray scale was handled is really good - very nice.', '2019-05-23 12:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630357, 1236891, 101256, '<td valign="top">To me, this seems slightly out of focus. The contrast is well done considering the lighting and the figures in the distance seem much more in focus that the rest of the image - perhaps the photographer used spot focusing more than  area auto focus?</td>', 'To me, this seems slightly out of focus. The contrast is well done considering the lighting and the figures in the distance seem much more in focus that the rest of the image - perhaps the photographer used spot focusing more than  area auto focus?', '2019-05-23 12:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630359, 1236675, 101256, '<td valign="top">I think every barn yard has a "junk" pile. And this goat is taking advantage of it - they do love to climb. Nice contrast, grays very nicely handled - very nice image.</td>', 'I think every barn yard has a "junk" pile. And this goat is taking advantage of it - they do love to climb. Nice contrast, grays very nicely handled - very nice image.', '2019-05-23 12:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630360, 1236758, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this image is meant to convey - it has some interesting elements, but frankly, and this is strictly my opinion, it seems to be a blank canvass.  Still, the conversion was well done - nice job.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this image is meant to convey - it has some interesting elements, but frankly, and this is strictly my opinion, it seems to be a blank canvass.  Still, the conversion was well done - nice job.', '2019-05-23 12:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630361, 1236880, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to think about this - I''m guessing it was a longer exposure, but the foreground seems much to detailed for that being a moon light image. I think a little more thought would have helped this image a lot because it does have some elements that could be impressive.</td>', 'Not sure what to think about this - I''m guessing it was a longer exposure, but the foreground seems much to detailed for that being a moon light image. I think a little more thought would have helped this image a lot because it does have some elements that could be impressive.', '2019-05-23 12:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630362, 1236762, 101256, '<td valign="top">There''s a story here - you could write a novel based on this one image. Contrasts are well done, the grays are perfect - great image - nice conversion.</td>', 'There''s a story here - you could write a novel based on this one image. Contrasts are well done, the grays are perfect - great image - nice conversion.', '2019-05-23 12:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630363, 1236864, 101256, '<td valign="top">Too gray - needs some more contrast as the image looks flat.  With a little better processing, you could have depth to the image which would make it really stand out.</td>', 'Too gray - needs some more contrast as the image looks flat.  With a little better processing, you could have depth to the image which would make it really stand out.', '2019-05-23 12:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630364, 1236360, 101256, '<td valign="top">I originally didn''t like this as I thought it looked too "busy", but after really looking at it, I''m beginning to see what the author saw. Nice job.</td>', 'I originally didn''t like this as I thought it looked too "busy", but after really looking at it, I''m beginning to see what the author saw. Nice job.', '2019-05-23 12:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630365, 1236888, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very nice candid capture - love the stairs. Contrast, black/white balance perfect, great focus - nicely done.</td>', 'Very nice candid capture - love the stairs. Contrast, black/white balance perfect, great focus - nicely done.', '2019-05-23 12:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630367, 1236853, 101256, '<td valign="top">Too dark - a little more work with contrast would help this tremendously.</td>', 'Too dark - a little more work with contrast would help this tremendously.', '2019-05-23 12:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630368, 1236878, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''ll admit that I rated this a 1 when I first viewed it - but after viewing it a second time, I think it deserves a higher rating - there is a certain abstract element to it which is appealing - not sure if the submitter intended it that way, but that''s the way I view it.</td>', 'I''ll admit that I rated this a 1 when I first viewed it - but after viewing it a second time, I think it deserves a higher rating - there is a certain abstract element to it which is appealing - not sure if the submitter intended it that way, but that''s the way I view it.', '2019-05-23 12:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630369, 1236868, 101256, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus, perfect contrast and B/W balance - very well done.</td>', 'Perfect focus, perfect contrast and B/W balance - very well done.', '2019-05-23 12:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630370, 1236863, 101256, '<td valign="top">simply gorgeous - perfect symmetry with a feeling of depth approaching 3D. Contrast and B/W scaling is perfect - very nicely done.</td>', 'simply gorgeous - perfect symmetry with a feeling of depth approaching 3D. Contrast and B/W scaling is perfect - very nicely done.', '2019-05-23 12:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630371, 1236730, 101256, '<td valign="top">Can''t say enough good things about this image - the feeling of "being there" is present as there is considerable depth to the image - which in this case was difficult due to the hill. Well done.</td>', 'Can''t say enough good things about this image - the feeling of "being there" is present as there is considerable depth to the image - which in this case was difficult due to the hill. Well done.', '2019-05-23 12:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630372, 1236632, 101256, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this. I  think it could have used a little less contrast - just a touch to bring out the darker tones, but that''s a nit pick. Perfect title, great candid image. Well done.</td>', 'I absolutely love this. I  think it could have used a little less contrast - just a touch to bring out the darker tones, but that''s a nit pick. Perfect title, great candid image. Well done.', '2019-05-23 12:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630373, 1236379, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is ethereal in a way - you could write a story about this image - very evocative. Contrast and B/W are very well done. Excellent entry.</td>', 'This is ethereal in a way - you could write a story about this image - very evocative. Contrast and B/W are very well done. Excellent entry.', '2019-05-23 12:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630374, 1236892, 101256, '<td valign="top">Love it - period end of discussion. I really hope this image wins.</td>', 'Love it - period end of discussion. I really hope this image wins.', '2019-05-23 12:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630376, 1236846, 101256, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image. You get a feeling of great depth and the detail is amazing. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Gorgeous image. You get a feeling of great depth and the detail is amazing. Very nicely done.', '2019-05-23 12:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630377, 1236578, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very nice conversion - contrast and B/W control is nicely done - overall, a nice image although a title giving some idea what the audience is looking at would have helped a lot.</td>', 'Very nice conversion - contrast and B/W control is nicely done - overall, a nice image although a title giving some idea what the audience is looking at would have helped a lot.', '2019-05-23 12:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630379, 1236522, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very nice image, but it seems to be over sharpened to bring out some of the detail. Still a very nice entry.</td>', 'Very nice image, but it seems to be over sharpened to bring out some of the detail. Still a very nice entry.', '2019-05-23 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630380, 1236760, 101256, '<td valign="top">Perfect and well beyond ordinary. Great lighting and contrast control - subject matter is interesting - I like this image a lot.</td>', 'Perfect and well beyond ordinary. Great lighting and contrast control - subject matter is interesting - I like this image a lot.', '2019-05-23 12:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630404, 1236640, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very good candid picture - excellent contrast control - well done.</td>', 'Very good candid picture - excellent contrast control - well done.', '2019-05-23 17:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630405, 1236899, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid snapshot style image - little detail along the shoreline is of interest - good contrast control - well done.</td>', 'A good solid snapshot style image - little detail along the shoreline is of interest - good contrast control - well done.', '2019-05-23 17:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630406, 1236881, 101256, '<td valign="top">My opinion that the difficult lighting affected your image by creating a light contrast condition. Its always difficult to shot images from shade to light and this is just shy of being very good in those terms.</td>', 'My opinion that the difficult lighting affected your image by creating a light contrast condition. Its always difficult to shot images from shade to light and this is just shy of being very good in those terms.', '2019-05-23 17:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630407, 1236867, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting image. Very good conversion and the contrast control along with the brightness level is near perfect. Very nice.</td>', 'This is a very interesting image. Very good conversion and the contrast control along with the brightness level is near perfect. Very nice.', '2019-05-23 17:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630409, 1236849, 101256, '<td valign="top">I would love to know what is happening here, but even so, it is a terrific candid capture. Another one of those images that could cause a writer to put together a story - there are so many directions it could take. Very nice capture- well done.</td>', 'I would love to know what is happening here, but even so, it is a terrific candid capture. Another one of those images that could cause a writer to put together a story - there are so many directions it could take. Very nice capture- well done.', '2019-05-23 17:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630410, 1236865, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is probably going to come across as pretentious, but this is an Ansel Adams level image. The technical aspects like contrast, brightness, etc., are perfect - also another image which evokes thoughts about a story - very well done - one of the best in this challenge series.</td>', 'This is probably going to come across as pretentious, but this is an Ansel Adams level image. The technical aspects like contrast, brightness, etc., are perfect - also another image which evokes thoughts about a story - very well done - one of the best in this challenge series.', '2019-05-23 18:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7630411, 1236842, 101256, '<td valign="top">Being honest, this image does nothing for me and just isn''t interesting to me - which is fine - we all don''t see the same things in the same way. However, the technical aspects of this are very good so it rates a 7 for technique.</td>', 'Being honest, this image does nothing for me and just isn''t interesting to me - which is fine - we all don''t see the same things in the same way. However, the technical aspects of this are very good so it rates a 7 for technique.', '2019-05-23 18:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
