(7630447, 1236650, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little too dark, but the whites are very well done so that''s a ice balance. It also appears to be very slightly over sharpened as you can see the edges instead of smooth curves and lines. Overall, it is nicely done.</td>', 'A little too dark, but the whites are very well done so that''s a ice balance. It also appears to be very slightly over sharpened as you can see the edges instead of smooth curves and lines. Overall, it is nicely done.', '2019-05-23 22:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
