(7631000, 1236864, 101668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by marnet:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on the HM, Ammie. I spent some time going through the archives of Ravilious'' photos and thought his photos had more contrast. A very fine image nevertheless. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hi Margaret, you are so right, of course, someone else mentioned the lack of contrast as well. This is a normal day on the farm and I was so fortunate to be at the right place and time. It was shot in colour and I changed it to BW to fit the challenge, never realising it needed more. But, hey, that is what make DPC worthwhile. All the constructive comments.</td>', 'Originally posted by marnet: Congrats on the HM, Ammie. I spent some time going through the archives of Ravilious'' photos and thought his photos had more contrast. A very fine image nevertheless.  Hi Margaret, you are so right, of course, someone else mentioned the lack of contrast as well. This is a normal day on the farm and I was so fortunate to be at the right place and time. It was shot in colour and I changed it to BW to fit the challenge, never realising it needed more. But, hey, that is what make DPC worthwhile. All the constructive comments.', '2019-05-27 05:26:34.000000', NULL, 0),
